    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillsHeading">Utility bills</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillsIntro">Import a bill PDF or enter it manually. Both paths produce the same canonical bill record: printed facts remain evidence, normalized classifications stay separate, and later calculations are never presented as if they were printed on the bill.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillEntryPdfTitle">Start from the PDF</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillEntryPdfIntro">The app preserves the original PDF, extracts only high-confidence facts and keeps everything reviewable before saving. Any detected field can be corrected.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillEntryManualTitle">First-class manual entry</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillEntryManualIntro">Enter the same facts a PDF import would populate. Manual entry keeps full audit capability, is marked as user-entered evidence, and can later be linked to the real PDF.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillPrimaryDataHeading">1. Period, consumption and identity</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillPrimaryDataIntro">Use exactly what is printed on the bill. If the document only prints dates, keep “Printed date only”; do not invent times.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillFinancialHeading">2. Printed totals and taxes</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillFinancialIntro">Enter amounts only when printed or explicitly available. The audit keeps those facts separate from later tariff reconstruction.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillIvaHint">Audit reference: Chilean standard VAT is 19%. The app reconstructs it only when a sufficient taxable base is available.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillPdfPreviewHeading">3. Review evidence detected in the PDF</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.BillPdfPreviewIntro">These lines are not canonical until the review is saved. Confirm descriptions and amounts against the document.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.SavedBillsHeading">Saved bills</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GridUtility.SavedBillsIntro">Select a bill to review provenance, correct it, or continue entering charge lines. Legacy bills remain visible but are not treated as reviewed automatically.</sys:String>
